3. env.oo IS oo_env_get, NOT RECURSIVE
---

Live `/home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA/ooda/std/os/env.oo`:

    14|pub fn env_get(cap: &EnvCap, key: String) -> Result[String, String] {
    15|    return oo_env_get(cap, key);
    16|}

Header beat: `2. env_get forwards to oo_env_get.`
No `return env_get(cap, key);` in the body.

SPRINT B5 close text still says `env.oo:6` / `env.oo:7`. After academy
headers the call is **line 15**. Path `ooda/std/os/env.oo` is right.
Line number is stale.

